  <h1>Kalamkari Textile Art: Hand-Painted Stories of Srikalahasti and Machilipatnam</h1>
  <p style="font-size: 12pt; color: #475569; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 16px;">The ancient art of vegetable-dyed storytelling using bamboo pens, myrobalan baths, and river water washing.</p>
  
