  <h2>Article Content</h2>
  <div class="article-content">
    
                
                
                <h2>The Pen That Weaves Myths</h2><p rtrvr-ls="5~hs,6~hs,8~hs,9~hs" rtrvr-ro="42">Literally translating to 'pen work' (<em>kalam</em> = pen, <em>kari</em> = craftsmanship), Kalamkari in Andhra Pradesh flourishes in two distinct historic hubs: Srikalahasti and Machilipatnam.</p>
              
              
              
